{
  "version": "2025.10",
  "description": "Brand personalization axis. [data-a63-brand=\"b1\"..\"b6\"] remaps the whole brand ramp\n(--a63-brand-50..950) to one of the six brand palettes; b1 is the default, so components work\nwith no [data-a63-brand] set. `auto` maps the ramp onto --color-auto-50..950, which the\npersonalization controller writes from the wallpaper at runtime, with a b1 fallback.\nThe primary action derived from the ramp lives in brand.css.",
  "resolutionOrder": [
    {
      "$ref": "#/modifiers/brand"
    }
  ],
